lass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle got 202% of normal in March to April and only 19% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 25% of normal on the middle. Grid 18423 had its driest year in 1956 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
